       "unit": "fiscal year",
       "value": 2026
      }
     },
     "literals": [],
     "text": "**Private and collaborative are not split here.** The vote subtracts the state repayment it expects from the collaborative line, $480,204 in FY2026, so that line looks over and private looks under because of where the subtraction is booked."
    },
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [],
     "text": "**Not shown:** which placements caused the overruns, or how many children. That needs counts the district does not publish: the Surprise costs page names them."
